import ../../site/games/farm/scene_landscape.dl

set world to the initial website farm world
set landscape to a website Farm landscape for world
set bank to a UI scene mesh bank
set frame to a UI scene frame using bank
set camera to a UI scene camera at (a UI scene vector from [12.0,18.0,15.0]) aimed at (a UI scene vector from [0.0,0.4,0.0]) with angle 35.0 aspect 1.0 near 0.1 far 150.0
prepare UI scene frame frame from (landscape's objects) through camera
require condition ((the length of frame's records) > 550) reporting "The Farm landscape omitted its tiles or detailed models"
require condition ((the length of bank's spans) < 40) reporting "Farm objects duplicated reusable mesh geometry"
set tile to the website farm square at 7 6 in world
set scenery to landscape's tiles + (6 * 20 + 7)
set placement to the UI scene placement of part 0 in (scenery's ground's instance)
set top to placement's bounds' maximum's y
require condition ((the absolute value of (top - (tile's height - 0.16))) < 0.00001) reporting "Channel terrain was not lowered with its picking bounds"
set pond to landscape's tiles + (3 * 20 + 3)
set placement to the UI scene placement of part 0 in (pond's water's instance)
require condition ((the absolute value of (placement's bounds' maximum's y - 0.3)) < 0.00001) reporting "Farm water did not retain the original lake level"
require condition (((the item at 0 in pond's water's instance's model's parts)'s casts shadow) = false) reporting "Water incorrectly casts a solid shadow"
set tree to landscape's tiles + (8 * 20 + 1)
require condition ((tree's tree's visible) and ((tree's stump's visible) = false)) reporting "A growing tree was replaced by its stump"
set (the website farm square at 1 8 in world)'s tree's regrow to 4
set tile to the website farm square at 8 9 in world
set tile's crop's growth to 0.1
set tile's moisture to 0.0
set crop to landscape's tiles + (9 * 20 + 8)
set count to the length of landscape's objects
update website Farm landscape landscape from world
require condition (((tree's tree's visible) = false) and (tree's stump's visible)) reporting "Harvested trees did not switch to stumps"
require condition (crop's crop key = 0) reporting "Changing growth did not replace the crop's stage model"
set tile's crop's growth to 0.8
update website Farm landscape landscape from world
require condition ((crop's crop key = 2) and ((the length of landscape's objects) = count)) reporting "Crop stages recreated objects instead of sharing their cached models"
set world's expanded to true
update website Farm landscape landscape from world
set selected to landscape's tiles + 19
set tint to selected's ground's color multiplier
require condition (tint's red > 0.9) reporting "Opening the east field retained its locked-land tint"
set tile to the website farm square at 9 14 in world
set pile to a new website farm item
set pile's kind to 9
set pile's count to 3
append pile to (tile's items)
update website Farm landscape landscape from world
set scenery to landscape's tiles + (14 * 20 + 9)
set eggs to the item at 0 in (scenery's piles)
require condition ((eggs's visible) and ((the length of eggs's instance's model's parts) = 4)) reporting "A three-egg pile lost its articulated model"
set (tile's items' data)'s count to 6
set world's compost's input to 20
update website Farm landscape landscape from world
require condition (((the item at 0 in scenery's piles) = eggs) and ((the length of eggs's instance's model's parts) = 7)) reporting "Changing egg quantity recreated the scene object or retained the old model"
clear tile's items
update website Farm landscape landscape from world
require condition ((eggs's visible) = false) reporting "An emptied ground pile remained visible"
set instance to landscape's compost's instance
set heap to the index of UI scene part named "heap" under 0 in (instance's model)
require condition ((the absolute value of ((the item at heap in (instance's poses))'s scale's y - 0.48)) < 0.00001) reporting "Compost heap growth was not reflected in the instance pose"
set revision to bank's revision
prepare UI scene frame frame from (landscape's objects) through camera
require condition (bank's revision = revision + 1) reporting "The newly visible stump did not add exactly its own mesh to the retained geometry"
set revision to bank's revision
prepare UI scene frame frame from (landscape's objects) through camera
require condition (bank's revision = revision) reporting "Repeated Farm frames uploaded unchanged immutable geometry"
close UI scene frame frame
close UI scene mesh bank bank
close website Farm landscape landscape
free website farm world world
print line "Farm landscapes share terrain, water and art geometry, update crops and tree states, and retain world-space picking bounds."
